{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-banner.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The First Mine</strong> is a relaxed turn based building and puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to run a productive gold mine by placing, grouping and upgrading various resource tiles without being distracted by different tasks and random game events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a single player or in multiplayer mode with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place, group and upgrade various tiles to collect resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a productive mine with your population to mine gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't let tasks and game events distract you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-1.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a calm and relaxed game alone in single player mode or play together with up to 4 friends in multi player mode. Each round you have to place, group and upgrade various tiles to mine gold and collect resources like wood, stone, wheat and fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To mine gold, you need people in your villages. To keep them, you must provide enough wheat and fish. More people and a higher level increases the amount of gold produced per round. You need wood and stone to upgrade the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-2.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to increase your yield per round, you can solve different tasks during the game and observe the requirements when placing tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are various random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters that can influence the game in a positive or negative way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-3.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player and multi player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of strategy, building and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based, relaxed and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Different tasks and simple resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements, highscores and leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine does not offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat and violence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2328840?t=1744019648","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744019648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/f1526320867d4975eb60c07ec7ce395b2e4b3cd0/