ect resources like wood, stone, wheat and fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To mine gold, you need people in your villages. To keep them, you must provide enough wheat and fish. More people and a higher level increases the amount of gold produced per round. You need wood and stone to upgrade the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-2.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to increase your yield per round, you can solve different tasks during the game and observe the requirements when placing tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are various random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters that can influence the game in a positive or negative way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-3.jpg?t=1744019648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player and multi player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of strategy, building and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based, relaxed and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Different tasks and simple resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements, highscores and leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine does not offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat and violence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Stefan B\u00f6ttcher"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/header.jpg?t=1744019648","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109657,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie480.mp4?t=1741175872","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie_max.mp4?t=1741175872"},"name":"Preview Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109657/722bad8299ad66ad2bd62ccaff820b6e59a03c2f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741175872","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741175872","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741175872"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257109668,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109668/movie480.mp4?t=1741175875","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109668/movie_max.mp4?t=1741175875"},"name":"Preview Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s